SUMMARY:Fall Bioblitz
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require pre-registration. Register for this program for ages 8+\nWelcome naturalists\, novices and general nature enthusiasts! Join us in documenting Prairie Ridge’s biodiversity – from fungi to birds\, we need your help to better understand what all lives at Prairie Ridge and how we can best steward our environment to support all species. We will focus on one area of the property to search high and low\, documenting everything we can find into iNaturalist.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/fall-bioblitz/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
