SUMMARY:Member Discovery Day - Leaves and Legends
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with us at our fall Member Discovery Day and get ready for our upcoming “Dragons” exhibition. Members are invited to enjoy a cozy night of mini pumpkin painting\, apple cider\, and fall-themed programs designed for curious minds of all ages. \nActivities include: \n\nPaint your own mini-pumpkin.\nEnjoy fall themed deserts and apple cider.\nMeet the Halloween Animals at 6:30pm and 7:15pm.\nExplore geology at our “Dragons Hord” table.\nCapture the moment at our photo booth\, with complimentary take home photo strips!\nand more…\n\nCurrent membership and pre-registration required. Not a member yet? Join today! \nRegister Now
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/member-discovery-day-leaves-and-legends/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages,Member Exclusive
